WEBVTT

00:12:58.816 --> 00:13:00.776
They'd be periodically whipped

00:13:00.818 --> 00:13:04.238
and subject to public abuse
by their constituents

00:13:04.238 --> 00:13:11.078
to sort of break down their egos
and remind them who's really in charge.

00:13:11.495 --> 00:13:15.833
It's a little bit different from what
we expect of our politicians today.

00:13:15.833 --> 00:13:20.379
And archaeologists, by the way,
have also worked at this place Tlaxcala,

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:23.465
excavating the remains
of the pre-conquest city,

00:13:23.507 --> 00:13:25.717
and what they found there
is really remarkable.

00:13:25.759 --> 00:13:30.305
Again, the most impressive architecture
is not temples and palaces.